#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:6
msgid "CTest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:8
msgid "Configure a project for testing with CTest/CDash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:10
msgid ""
"Include this module in the top ``CMakeLists.txt`` file of a project to "
"enable testing with CTest and dashboard submissions to CDash:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:13
msgid ""
"project(MyProject)\n"
"...\n"
"include(CTest)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:19
msgid "The module automatically creates the following variables:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:21
msgid ":variable:`BUILD_TESTING`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:23
msgid ""
"Option selecting whether ``include(CTest)`` calls :command:`enable_testing`. "
"The option is ``ON`` by default when created by the module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:26
msgid "After including the module, use code like:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:28
msgid ""
"if(BUILD_TESTING)\n"
"  # ... CMake code to create tests ...\n"
"endif()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:34
msgid "to creating tests when testing is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:36
msgid ""
"To enable submissions to a CDash server, create a ``CTestConfig.cmake`` file "
"at the top of the project with content such as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:39
msgid ""
"set(CTEST_NIGHTLY_START_TIME \"01:00:00 UTC\")\n"
"set(CTEST_SUBMIT_URL \"http://my.cdash.org/submit.php?project=MyProject\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:44
msgid ""
"The CDash server can provide the file to a project administrator who "
"configures ``MyProject``.  Settings in the config file are shared by both "
"this ``CTest`` module and the :manual:`ctest(1)` command-"
"line :ref:`Dashboard Client` mode (:option:`ctest -S`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:49
msgid ""
"While building a project for submission to CDash, CTest scans the build "
"output for errors and warnings and reports them with surrounding context "
"from the build log.  This generic approach works for all build tools, but "
"does not give details about the command invocation that produced a given "
"problem.  One may get more detailed reports by setting "
"the :variable:`CTEST_USE_LAUNCHERS` variable:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:56
msgid "set(CTEST_USE_LAUNCHERS 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:60
msgid "in the ``CTestConfig.cmake`` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:65
msgid "Dashboard Targets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:67
msgid ""
"When :variable:`BUILD_TESTING` is enabled, the module also adds custom "
"targets to the build system that run a :ref:`Dashboard Client` from the "
"build tree and submit the results.  Each target runs :option:`ctest -S` on a "
"script generated by the module in ``CMakeFiles/CTestScript.cmake``. The "
"script is configured with the settings collected by the module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:73
msgid "The following targets are added for all generators:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:75
msgid "``Experimental``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:76
msgid ""
"Run the ``Start``, ``Configure``, ``Build``, ``Test``, ``Coverage``, and "
"``Submit`` steps in ``Experimental`` mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:79
msgid "``Nightly``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:80
msgid ""
"Run the ``Start``, ``Update``, ``Configure``, ``Build``, ``Test``, "
"``Coverage``, and ``Submit`` steps in ``Nightly`` mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:83
msgid "``Continuous``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:84
msgid ""
"Run the same steps as ``Nightly`` in ``Continuous`` mode, but stop after the "
"``Update`` step if it reports no changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:87
msgid "``NightlyMemoryCheck``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:88
msgid ""
"Run the ``Start``, ``Update``, ``Configure``, ``Build``, ``MemCheck``, "
"``Coverage``, and ``Submit`` steps in ``Nightly`` mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:91
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Makefile Generators`, :ref:`Ninja Generators`, "
"and :generator:`FASTBuild` generator also add a ``<Mode><Step>`` target for "
"each combination of ``<Mode>`` in ``Experimental``, ``Nightly``, and "
"``Continuous`` and ``<Step>`` in ``Start``, ``Update``, ``Configure``, "
"``Build``, ``Test``, ``Coverage``, ``MemCheck``, and ``Submit``.  Each runs "
"only that step, such as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:98
msgid "cmake --build . --target ExperimentalTest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../Modules/CTest.cmake:102
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Dashboard Client` documentation for details on each step and "
"mode."
msgstr ""
